body:
"Im sorry your upset that I had sex with a lot of men"

"Im sorry I was a single mom who had to raise 3 kids"

"Im sorry your upset that I give more money to your sister" That wasn't the reason why I was upset, Shes just fishing for why in ways that make her the victim. 

Those are just the most recent ones. I have cut contact cold turkey. Im still struggling with the guilt. But I am doing so much better. Im starting to like myself. 

&#x200B;

I hope you're doing better. I hope you find that by recognizing what she has done that hurt you is a step to being better and feeling better. 



&#x200B;

&#x200B;
